 Note    Macro will not work if Keyran Drivers are no activated

 GAME SETTINGS

 resolution  1920 x1080

 fov  85

 Horizontal Sensitivity 13
 Vertical Sensitivity 13


 DPI 1000

 created by HOODIExSZN
 Enjoy!</Description>
